# A `bin` key takes the column's name (LANGUAGE.md §3.3) and bins datetimes from the epoch.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where timestamp < datetime(2024-01-01)
| summarize orders = count() by bin(timestamp, 7d)
| sort by timestamp asc
---- expected
timestamp            | orders
datetime             | long
---------------------+-------
2023-11-30T00:00:00Z |      1
2023-12-07T00:00:00Z |      2
2023-12-14T00:00:00Z |      1
2023-12-21T00:00:00Z |      3
2023-12-28T00:00:00Z |      2
